sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant PA as producer-api
    participant K as Kafka: notification-requests
    participant SC as JDBC Sink Connector
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant NC as notifier-consumer

    B->>PA: POST /notify
    PA->>K: produce (JSON w/ inline schema)
    PA-->>B: 202 Accepted (event published, near-instant)
    par DB write (independent consumer group)
        K->>SC: poll
        SC->>PG: UPSERT stream_notifications
    and Notification delivery (independent consumer group)
        K->>NC: poll
        NC-->>B: WebSocket message (delivered)
    end
